      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i write is just... hollow. like i'm just playing pretend. i've been staring at this one verse for hours about how nothing really matters and how the only real way to leave a mark is to actually feel everything, even the parts that break you. i just feel so heavy lately. like i'm just waiting for something to finally end so i can actually feel something real.",
